<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Wankie raises half yr pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Wankie raises half yr pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million $ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Profit before interest    73.29   vs   58.15</p>
<p>    Net interest		   1.97   vs   13.38</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	   75.26   vs   71.53</p>
<p>    Tax			     26.98   vs   22.58</p>
<p>    Ordinary dividend	   12.67   vs   12.67</p>
<p>    Earnings per shr (cts)	 29   vs	29</p>
<p>    Dividends per shr (cts)     7.5   vs     7.5</p>
<p>Full name: Wankie Colliery Co Ltd (mining)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
